{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-1","kind":"proposition","title":"等边三角形的尺规作图","englishTitle":"On a given finite straight line to construct an equilateral triangle.","book":1,"number":1,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.1","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.1/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":1,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-1@raw-031fd0f013ed81a9","contentId":"euclid-1-1","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"031fd0f013ed81a958936d23b425636ef44829789d6dc126a9e95aa94cb7d995","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-1.statement","euclid-1-1.construction.1","euclid-1-1.proof.1","euclid-1-1.construction.2","euclid-1-1.proof.2","euclid-1-1.proof.3","euclid-1-1.proof.4","euclid-1-1.proof.5","euclid-1-1.proof.6","euclid-1-1.proof.7","euclid-1-1.conclusion","euclid-1-1.historical.1","euclid-1-1.historical.2","euclid-1-1.historical.3","euclid-1-1.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-1.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-1","revisionId":"euclid-1-1@raw-031fd0f013ed81a9","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"022da8421528dbf0a284113269b6f37e5026320934987e74e0b97f89a6ebf8a1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"On a given finite straight line to construct an equilateral triangle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在给定的有限线段上，作一个等边三角形。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"于有界直线上，求立平边三角形。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在给定的有限线段上，作一个等边三角形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-1.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-1","revisionId":"euclid-1-1@raw-031fd0f013ed81a9","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"596f8524bb25e51ea27733539d13967bdb5affba7efbda0b366a12f3470eee5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be the given finite straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB成为给定的限定直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-1.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-1","revisionId":"euclid-1-1@raw-031fd0f013ed81a9","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8d4a4dcf95494228d5389e08205784ee89ace6b89cb6863eed13ff550469868b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Thus it is required to construct an equilateral triangle on the straight line AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,它必须在直线AB上建造一个等边三角形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-1.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-1","revisionId":"euclid-1-1@raw-031fd0f013ed81a9","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3d00b7f24668de9b8d8d86225e347edc96cdc72af775ba957002b5ec89ae4eb5","citations":["euclid-1-post-3","euclid-1-post-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"With centre A and distance AB let the circle BCD be described; [[Post. 3](/principles/euclid-1-post-3)] again, with centre B and distance BA let the circle ACE be described; [[Post. 3](/principles/euclid-1-post-3)] and from the point C, in which the circles cut one another, to the points A, B let the straight lines CA, CB be joined. [[Post. 1](/principles/euclid-1-post-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"以A和AB距离为中心,BCD圆圈可以说明;以B和BA中间线为中心,ACE圆圈可以说明;从圆圈相互切开的C点,到A点,B圆圈可以把CA、CB直线连接起来。 [[Post. 3](/principles/euclid-1-post-3)] [[Post. 3](/principles/euclid-1-post-3)] [[Post. 1](/principles/euclid-1-post-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-1.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-1","revisionId":"euclid-1-1@raw-031fd0f013ed81a9","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"06843df463801fbf331b1eed81ea7afaab3486b2783becc7596afbd84d20dae7","citations":["euclid-1-def-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the point A is the centre of the circle CDB, AC is equal to AB. [[Def. 15](/principles/euclid-1-def-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,A点是CDB,AC等于AB的圆的中心。 [[Def. 15](/principles/euclid-1-def-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-1.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-1","revisionId":"euclid-1-1@raw-031fd0f013ed81a9","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"156495b36ca8c77b7afe4defaed2e8455361130ca565fba9b3ad6bc575c0b656","citations":["euclid-1-def-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since the point B is the centre of the circle CAE, BC is equal to BA. [[Def. 15](/principles/euclid-1-def-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于B点是CAE点的中心,BC点等于BA点。 [[Def. 15](/principles/euclid-1-def-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-1.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-1","revisionId":"euclid-1-1@raw-031fd0f013ed81a9","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e1fc54061c22c9630534ecc129cdab696b4ade460f82ddcdbd610b13bb894c0f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But CA was also proved equal to AB; therefore each of the straight lines CA, CB is equal to AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但CA也证明等于AB,因此,CA直线和CB直线各等于AB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-1.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-1","revisionId":"euclid-1-1@raw-031fd0f013ed81a9","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6eded7bb6b57bc3c24b69633bfde8055389633e70e072fbb686042b21033fa73","citations":["euclid-1-cn-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And things which are equal to the same thing are also equal to one another; [[C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)] therefore CA is also equal to CB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"等同的东西 也彼此平等, 因此CA 也等于 CB。 [[C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-1.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-1-1","revisionId":"euclid-1-1@raw-031fd0f013ed81a9","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5a4fb134bce1c2052b14341d33c089afb950e5d2fdb5ce9a7677826526fc82cf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the three straight lines CA, AB, BC are equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,三条直线CA,AB,BC是等同的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-1.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-1-1","revisionId":"euclid-1-1@raw-031fd0f013ed81a9","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ca68fd2a79c323d4c74c9d25981ccea7cfc5fa506eaa1a933d88c9b8e2df579e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the triangle ABC is equilateral; and it has been constructed on the given finite straight line AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,三角形ABC是等边形;它建在给定的限定直线AB上。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-1.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-1","revisionId":"euclid-1-1@raw-031fd0f013ed81a9","order":10,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c4ec7554215d9139a4b15f0189508b6eee6efdfa12271ab024eb98a0523f5185","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"(Being) what it was required to do."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"这正是所要求作的图形；作图完成。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-1.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-1","revisionId":"euclid-1-1@raw-031fd0f013ed81a9","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f7fb3d6ff42f053fe229d0a0b12b5cc015e21e64d1ffa94db6f7a07b73269b12","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"于有界直线上，求立平边三角形。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在给定的有限线段上，作一个等边三角形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-1.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-1","revisionId":"euclid-1-1@raw-031fd0f013ed81a9","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7ef42130ee2d6ecfc9216bd6f65d91ba5b3d37a12fb94228ea4288ea1070068e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：以甲为心至圜之界，其甲乙线与甲丙、甲丁线等，以乙为心，则乙甲线与乙丙、乙丁线亦等。何者？凡为圜心，自心至界各线俱等故。〈界说十五。〉既乙丙等于甲乙，即甲丙亦等于乙丙。〈公论一。〉三遍等，如所求。〈凡论有二种，此以是为论者、正论也，下仿此。〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明：以甲为圆心所作圆的半径甲乙、甲丙、甲丁都相等；以乙为圆心所作圆的半径乙甲、乙丙、乙丁也都相等，因为同一圆中，从圆心到圆周的各条线段都相等〈界说十五。〉。既然乙丙等于甲乙，甲丙也等于甲乙，因此甲丙等于乙丙〈公论一。〉。三条边彼此相等，于是得到所求的等边三角形。〈凡论有二种，此以是为论者、正论也，下仿此。〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-1.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-1","revisionId":"euclid-1-1@raw-031fd0f013ed81a9","order":13,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"046ec7bca2ef0b454436f7266d3cdda9b8a0b9c95dc917bc00b344cb89bc1a56","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"诸三角形俱推前用法作之。〈详本篇廾二。〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其他三角形的作图也可参照前述方法加以推演〈详本篇廾二。〉。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-1.source","contentId":"euclid-1-1","revisionId":"euclid-1-1@raw-031fd0f013ed81a9","order":14,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"895acd287df1d54ee00b390e3f5a8af875e190cf1850e17a0faa68fe36fbb0d0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.1/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.1\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-1:euclid-1-post-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-1","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-1.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-post-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.1","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.1/","sourceLabel":"Post. 3"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-1:euclid-1-post-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-1","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-1.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-post-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.1","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.1/","sourceLabel":"Post. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-1:euclid-1-def-15:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-1","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-1.proof.2","euclid-1-1.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-def-15","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.1","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.1/","sourceLabel":"Def. 15"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-1:euclid-1-cn-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-1","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-1.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-cn-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.1","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.1/","sourceLabel":"C.N. 1"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-2:euclid-1-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-2","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-2.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.2","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.2/","sourceLabel":"I. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-10:euclid-1-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-10","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-10.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"expl